---

{{headline.en}}

{{claimer.firstName}} {{claimer.lastName}} ({{profileButtonUrl}}) has requested to claim the organization
{{organization.name}} ({{organizationButtonUrl}}).

What to do:
- Check if the person is affiliated with the organization.
- If yes, make the person an administrator and a team member of the organization and set the status of the request
to "accepted" (organization_claim_requests) and the organization to shadow=false.
- Send the person an email indicating that they are now an administrator of the requested organization (Mail template in
the {{supportMail}} inbox).
- If no, send the person an email requesting further information (Mail template in the {{supportMail}} inbox).
- If no response is received or the proof cannot be provided, set the status of the request to "rejected"
(organization_claim_requests) and inform the person via email.

{{profileButtonText.en}}: {{profileButtonUrl}}
{{organizationButtonText.en}}: {{organizationButtonUrl}}